{"id":"0712917c544c264822c2c2741f7c457b","choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I'll now submit the complete performance for this shot using the compact contract. The shot covers two action steps from beat B03:林屿's侧身+抽取三张便利贴+点浅黄 (steps.0), and拿笔反转伸出并握住等接 (steps.2). The中间对白读清单由程序自动绑定到steps.1。\n\nStep 0 begins from the verified start state: C01 standing at her desk, C02 sitting at his desk; P05 was pushed toward两人之间 in B01; P07 sits on E02桌沿. I need to:\n- Have C02侧身 toward C01's desk corner, take the three便利贴 (P03_Y, P03_P, P03_B) in sequence, lay them on his own桌面, then point at浅黄.\n- Then C02 takes P07 from E02桌沿, reverses it笔尖朝C01, extends hand holding笔 across两桌之间, waiting for C01 to接.\n- C01 must show explicit face change toward C02 during step 0 (侧身 visible).","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_01a10b294b08773ea7279db2","type":"function","function":{"name":"submit_creative_json","arguments":"{\"payload_json\":\"{\\\"dialogue_performance\\\":\\\"画内整句对白由程序自动绑定到 steps.1：林屿低头侧身，嘴形清晰，语速自然平稳，三字一顿，轻读不抬眉，读完最后一个字嘴合拢、不看方澄。\\\", \\\"actions\\\":[{\\\"source_step_ref\\\":\\\"raw_linear_script.beats.2.steps.0\\\",\\\"groups\\\":[{\\\"seconds\\\":1.2,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿上半身从朝向自己桌面转为侧身朝向方澄桌角，右手从桌面抬起准备去拿便利贴。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[[\\\"face\\\",\\\"C02\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"C01\\\"]]]},{\\\"seconds\\\":1.5,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿右手伸到方澄桌角便利贴叠上方，捏起浅黄对账便利贴离开桌面。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[[\\\"take\\\",\\\"C02\\\",\\\"P03_Y\\\",\\\"\\\"]]},{\\\"seconds\\\":0.4,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿把浅黄便利贴平摊在自己面前桌面上。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[[\\\"place\\\",\\\"C02\\\",\\\"P03_Y\\\",\\\"surface:E02:面前\\\"]]},{\\\"seconds\\\":1.2,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿右手回到方澄桌角，捏起浅粉改明细便利贴离开桌面。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[[\\\"take\\\",\\\"C02\\\",\\\"P03_P\\\",\\\"\\\"]]},{\\\"seconds\\\":0.4,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿把浅粉便利贴平摊在自己桌面上，与浅黄并排。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[[\\\"place\\\",\\\"C02\\\",\\\"P03_P\\\",\\\"surface:E02:面前\\\"]]},{\\\"seconds\\\":1.2,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿右手再到方澄桌角，捏起浅蓝收尾便利贴离开桌面。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[[\\\"take\\\",\\\"C02\\\",\\\"P03_B\\\",\\\"\\\"]]},{\\\"seconds\\\":0.4,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿把浅蓝便利贴平摊在自己桌面上，三张并排成一行。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[[\\\"place\\\",\\\"C02\\\",\\\"P03_B\\\",\\\"surface:E02:面前\\\"]]},{\\\"seconds\\\":1.0,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿右手食指指尖点在最左侧那张浅黄便利贴上，给出今晚第一件事的可见强调。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[]},{\\\"seconds\\\":0.8,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C01\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"方澄侧身站着未伸手，肩线克制，目光落在林屿点住的那张浅黄便利贴上，等他开口。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[]}]},{\\\"source_step_ref\\\":\\\"raw_linear_script.beats.2.steps.2\\\",\\\"groups\\\":[{\\\"seconds\\\":1.4,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿右手抬到自己桌沿，捏起黑色签字笔离开桌面，五指握住笔身。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[[\\\"take\\\",\\\"C02\\\",\\\"P07\\\",\\\"\\\"]]},{\\\"seconds\\\":1.0,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿在桌面半空中把签字笔翻转，笔尖由朝自己改为朝方澄那一侧。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[]},{\\\"seconds\\\":1.2,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿把反转后笔尖朝方澄那一侧的签字笔伸到两人桌面之间的位置，握笔右手悬停不落，等待她接。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[]},{\\\"seconds\\\":1.0,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C01\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"方澄侧身站着，视线从那张浅黄便利贴顺握笔悬停的手向上抬向林屿的眼睛，承担开口说不之前的可见犹豫。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[]}]}]}\"}"}}]}}],"created":1791188604,"model":"MiniMax-M3","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"total_tokens":18760,"total_characters":0,"prompt_tokens":17755,"completion_tokens":1005,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":128}},"input_sensitive":false,"output_sensitive":false,"input_sensitive_type":0,"output_sensitive_type":0,"output_sensitive_int":0,"service_tier":"standard","base_resp":{"status_code":0,"status_msg":""}}
